{"output":"I’ll locate the search request handling, check the existing tests, and make a focused fix for stale requests.\n\nThe controller applies every request’s completion without checking whether a newer search has started. I’ll add a request counter, advanced even when the query is cleared, and guard results, errors, and loading updates. The worktree is clean; the shell emitted a startup warning, so I’ll use a clean shell for verification.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search updates results, errors, or loading. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module passed 6 additional race scenarios; git diff --check passed. All exited 0.\n\nPublic API unchanged. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search updates results, errors, or loading. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module passed 6 additional race scenarios; git diff --check passed. All exited 0.\n\nPublic API unchanged. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":12,"tool_calls":[{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-3-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":386,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-1f9a81a76653d5deacc380c84d2cc179.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && git diff --check && git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-3-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":325,"stdout_bytes":520,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-f7fe1328a6bd72c0c2225e3a3bd53f62.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst item = title => [{ id: title, title, url: '/' }];\nfor (const fail of [false, true]) {\n  for (const order of ['old-first', 'new-first', 'clear']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('new');\n    if (order === 'new-first') {\n      requests[1].resolve(item('new'));\n      await current;\n    } else if (order === 'clear') {\n      await c.search('  ');\n    }\n    const before = c.getState();\n    if (fail) requests[0].reject(new Error('stale error'));\n    else requests[0].resolve(item('old'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n    if (order !== 'new-first') {\n      requests[1].resolve(item('new'));\n      await current;\n    }\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), order === 'clear'\n      ? { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null }\n      : { query: 'new', results: item('new'), loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('PASS: 6 stale-success/failure and query-clear scenarios');\nNODE","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/2-3-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":74,"stdout_bytes":56,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-957fcc7eda02e8b26d7e0b0e4ef8f62f.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":56497,"output_tokens":1081}}
